      "name": "Zelianna",
      "normal_spell_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Tinkerer",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "<p>You may perform the Inventory action and spend 3 Inventory Points to create a firearm<br>weapon known as a magicannon (see below).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The magicannon will crumble to pieces as soon as you use create a new magicannon.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>When you create a magicannon, choose<br>the type of damage it deals (air, bolt, earth, fire, ice, or physical).</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Swap Catridge",
          "target": ""
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Sharpshooter",
          "cost": "10",
          "description": "<p>When you perform a ranged attack, you may spend 10 Mind Points to choose one<br>option: the attack gains multi (2); or you increase the attack's multi property by one,<br>up to a maximum of multi (3)</p>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Barrage",
          "target": ""
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Sharpshooter",
          "cost": "0",
          "description": "<p>When you perform the Guard action, if you choose not to provide cover to another<br>creature, you may choose one option:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the next ranged attack you perform before the end of the current scene will deal 【<strong>10</strong>】 extra damage;</li>\n<li>or you may immediately<br>perform a free attack with a bow or firearm you have equipped, treating your High Roll<br>(HR) as 0 when calculating damage dealt by this attack</li>\n</ul>",
          "duration": "",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Steady Aim(Hawkeye)",
          "target": ""
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Tinkerer",
          "cost": "10",
          "description": "<p>You imbue a weapon with the cleansing energy of your spirit.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Until this spell ends, all damage dealt by the weapon becomes of the <strong>light</strong> type.</p>\n<p>If you have that weapon equipped while you cast this spell, you may perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with it as part of the same action.</p>\n<p><br>This spell can only be cast on a weapon equipped by a willing creature.</p>",
          "duration": "Scene",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Hollow Point Catridges(Magisphere - Soul Weapon)",
          "target": "One Equipped Weapon"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Tinkerer",
          "cost": "20",
          "description": "<p>You allow a creature to focus their vital energy into accomplishing what they previously could not.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Choose one Attribute: <strong>Dexterity, Insight, Might, or Willpower.</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Until this spell ends, the target treats the chosen Attribute as if it were one die size higher (up to a maximum of d12).</p>",
          "duration": "Scene",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Stimpack (Magisphere - Awaken)",
          "target": "One creature"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Tinkerer",
          "cost": "10 x T",
          "description": "<p>You invigorate your companions, soothing their pain and healing their fatigue.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Each target recovers <strong>40</strong> Hit Points.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>This amount increases to 50 Hit Points if you are level20 or higher, or to 60 Hit Points if you are level 40 or higher.</p>",
          "duration": "Instantenous",
          "roll": "",
          "spell_name": "Medipack(Magicphere - Heal)",
          "target": "Up to three creatures"
        }
      },
